== set_concl
goal Arg: arg Hyps: 1.x :H Goal:C, after set_concl D: Arg: arg Hyps: 1.x :H Goal:D, assumptions kept 1
== attribute printers (width 100)
-- addTermListT e []
Annotate: A with attrs < > A with attrs < term_lists = [ e->[] ]; >
-- addTermListT o [T]
Annotate: A with attrs < > A with attrs < term_lists = [ o->[ T ] ]; >
-- addBoolT f false
Annotate: A with attrs < > A with attrs < bools = [ f->ff ]; >
== prefix_thenFLT
idT, then [idT]                      1 subgoal(s)
idT, then [idT; idT]                 refused (thenFLT: list length mismatch)
idT, then []                         refused (thenFLT: list length mismatch)
idT, then [cutT B]                   2 subgoal(s)
cutT B, then one idT per subgoal     2 subgoal(s)
cutT B, then [idT]                   refused (thenFLT: list length mismatch)
== removeOptionT
addOptionT pa allow; pe exclude      1 subgoal(s)
options [Perv!select["pa":t]=ййallow; Perv!select["pe":t]=ййexclude]
removeOptionT pa                     1 subgoal(s)
options [Perv!select["pe":t]=ййexclude]
removeOptionT pz (never set)         1 subgoal(s)
options [Perv!select["pa":t]=ййallow; Perv!select["pe":t]=ййexclude]
== finalT
  hook h1 ran
  hook h2 ran
finalT h1 then finalT h2             1 subgoal(s)
idT (the hooks do not run again)     1 subgoal(s)
finalT h3, then a refusal            refused (thenFLT: list length mismatch)
idT (after the refusal)              1 subgoal(s)
== timingT
timingT (cutT B)                     2 subgoal(s)
stderr: User time N System time N Real time N
